      "title": "Agreed order form",
      "text": "Seller: Kivuli Sandal Studio, Kenya\nBuyer: Nara Vale\nOrder date: 4 March 2025\nPayment method: PayPal\nCurrency: USD\n\nAgreed goods and packing requirements:\n- Supply two pairs of brown leather sandals in EU size 40.\n- Include two cotton drawstring storage bags.\n- Stamp the buyer's initials NV on each sandal footbed.\n- Include four spare leather ankle straps.\n\nGoods: USD 96\nPacking and shipping: USD 14\nTotal: USD 110\n\nThe buyer approved these requirements before payment. The sandals and accessories are to be packed together in one parcel for delivery to the buyer."
    },
    {
      "title": "Parcel handover note",
      "text": "Kivuli Sandal Studio\nHandover date: 12 March 2025\nBuyer: Nara Vale\nCarrier: DHL Express\nTracking: J7K4M2N8P6Q3\n\nThe parcel was sealed and handed to the courier today. The packing sheet records: two pairs of brown leather sandals in EU size 40; no cotton drawstring storage bags; two spare leather ankle straps. The remaining two straps were not packed.\n\nThe footbeds were covered by protective tissue before the packing check. The handover note does not record whether initials were stamped beneath the tissue. The buyer was sent the tracking details after handover and asked to check the contents on arrival."
    },
    {
      "title": "Chat after delivery",
      "text": "18 March, 09:12 — Nara: The parcel arrived this morning. I opened it and found the two pairs of brown sandals in size 40.\n18 March, 09:15 — Nara: There were no cotton bags in the box, and I found only two spare ankle straps.\n18 March, 09:28 — Kivuli: Thanks for checking. Our packing sheet also shows no bags and only two spare straps.\n18 March, 09:31 — Nara: I have not checked the footbeds for the initials yet; the tissue is still on them.\n18 March, 09:36 — Kivuli: Please let us know when you have checked. We can discuss the missing accessories separately."
    }
  ],
